# DesignRoom's model: qwen3.5:9b with our settings baked in (M1-15 spike, docs/spikes/M1-15-qwen.md).
# The OpenAI-compatible endpoint can't pass Ollama options, and loads models with only 4096 tokens
# of context: a bigger board + chat history would be cut off silently. Build it once:
#   ollama create designroom-qwen -f infra/ollama/Modelfile
FROM qwen3.5:9b

# 128k context (M1-24c): 9.9 GB of VRAM, all on the GPU. Only 8 of the model's 32 layers keep a
# per-token cache, so it grows slowly (16k: 6.1 GB, 64k: 7.7 GB). The VRAM is reserved once at load;
# each request costs what it sends. Keep LLM_CONTEXT_TOKENS in apps/server/.env equal to this.
PARAMETER num_ctx 131072

# Non-thinking sampling from the Qwen model card.
PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER top_p 0.8
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER presence_penalty 1.5
